msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-takerf745.rst:61
#: 808dd5319a0844948e1648c7ad9f285a
msgid "FrSky Telemetry is supported using the Tx pin of any UART. You need to set the following parameters to enable support for FrSky S.PORT (example shows SERIAL3)."
